peaseblossom (0.12.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to 0.12.0: the runtime modules Coroutines and Tasks
    (cooperative tasks: conditions, mutexes, channels, Select,
    timeouts), with TaskInput, on both back ends; make examples and
    make examples-vax. The compiler is unchanged; a library from an
    older poc must be rebuilt.

